        {
            "_id": "2JmDrtvhB4DzRTvk",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp",
            "name": "Balance Fields",
            "sort": 300000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "reaction"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The crystal-pulse construct would be affected by an effect with the electricity trait or by any spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The construct vents energy in an attempt to stabilize its animating fields. All creatures within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] take @Damage[8d6[untyped]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:28|basic] save). If the triggering effect had the electricity trait, this is electricity damage, and if it was triggered by a spell, this is force damage. If the reaction is triggered by an electricity spell, the damage is either electricity or force, whichever would be more detrimental to creatures in the area, as determined by the GM.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": []
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "qpWk46JKYfzsVElQ",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Charged Suspension",
            "sort": 400000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Electrical fields intensify around a target creature within 60 feet, attempting to lift it from the ground. The target must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:29] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Suppressed] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Immobilized] until it [[/act escape dc=29]]{Escapes} and is also suppressed for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but suppressed for 1 minute.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "arcane"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "Q8mG9CuInWLde01s",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Shocking Deformation",
            "sort": 500000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The construct temporarily flies apart into its constituent elements until its fields bring it back together. All creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] take 6d6 slashing plus @Damage[3d12[electricity]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:29|basic] save. The crystal-pulse construct then reforms itself in any space large enough for it within the emanation. This movement does not provoke reactions.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "arcane",
                        "electricity"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        }
